<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoRan Resource.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoRan Resource.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it downgraded Freeport-McMoRan Resource Partners LP to market underperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares were off 1/16 to 13-7/8.</p>
</text>
